body:
The provisions of this ordinance shall, except as specifically provided otherwise
               in this ordinance, apply to all land within the jurisdiction of the City.
(Ordinance 05-018-00 adopted 9/1/05; Ordinance 17-012-00, secs. 4, 5, adopted 3/2/17;
               Ordinance 17-049-00 adopted 7/20/17; Ordinance 19-044-00, secs. 3, 4, adopted 8/15/19;
               Ordinance 20-022-00, sec. 5, adopted 4/21/20)

The provisions of this ordinance shall not apply to:
(a)
Cemeteries which obtain a Special Use Permit and comply with all state and local laws
                  and regulations;
(b)
Legal lots, parcels or tracts created by order of a court of competent jurisdiction;
(c)
Commitments for the construction of public utility buildings for the City made prior
                  to the passage of this ordinance.
(Ordinance 05-018-00 adopted 9/1/05; Ordinance 17-012-00, secs. 4, 5, adopted 3/2/17;
               Ordinance 17-049-00 adopted 7/20/17; Ordinance 19-044-00, secs. 3, 4, adopted 8/15/19;
               Ordinance 20-022-00, sec. 5, adopted 4/21/20)
